\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Select-first online prefill on one H20 (Qwen3-8B, bf16/SDPA, median of three after one warmup). Dense runs the stock full-context path; CoMem uses its rank-32 LoRA and a fixed 6,657-token top-12 pack. This cohort times online model prefill after the persistent memory is built; it excludes one-time document Write and external-store fetch. The speedup is therefore an online bounded-read operating point, not a production end-to-end or depth-only causal effect.}}{11}{table.caption.25}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:online-prefill}{{7}{11}{Select-first online prefill on one H20 (Qwen3-8B, bf16/SDPA, median of three after one warmup). Dense runs the stock full-context path; CoMem uses its rank-32 LoRA and a fixed 6,657-token top-12 pack. This cohort times online model prefill after the persistent memory is built; it excludes one-time document Write and external-store fetch. The speedup is therefore an online bounded-read operating point, not a production end-to-end or depth-only causal effect}{table.caption.25}{}}
