\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {23}{\ignorespaces Matched-$n{=}100$ Qwen3-8B RULER scaling. $^\dagger $YaRN factor 4 gives an effective 163,840-token window. At 128k, unextended-backbone CoMem+LoRA scores 98/93/99.0 on single-needle, multikey, and variable tracking, versus 100/89/57.8 for KV-Direct+YaRN. Applying YaRN to CoMem changes these to 98/93/93.6, showing an in-window position-scaling tax on variable tracking.}}{18}{table.caption.45}\protected@file@percent }
